 ],
 "captions": [
  {
   "text": "So you think you could",
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 0.83
  },
  {
   "text": "be an air traffic controller.",
   "start": 0.83,
   "end": 2.4
  },
  {
   "text": "It’s an appealing thought.",
   "start": 2.4,
   "end": 3.78
  },
  {
   "text": "You sit in a dim",
   "start": 3.78,
   "end": 4.64
  },
  {
   "text": "room in front of a",
   "start": 4.64,
   "end": 5.37
  },
  {
   "text": "glowing scope.",
   "start": 5.37,
   "end": 6.54
  },
  {
   "text": "You speak in that calm,",
   "start": 6.54,
   "end": 7.81
  },
  {
   "text": "clipped,",
   "start": 7.81,
   "end": 8.45
  },
  {
   "text": "unbothered voice.",
   "start": 8.45,
   "end": 9.77
  },
  {
   "text": "You hold hundreds of lives",
   "start": 9.77,
   "end": 11.18
  },
  {
   "text": "in your hands and your",
   "start": 11.18,
   "end": 12.28
  },
  {
   "text": "pulse never moves.",
   "start": 12.28,
   "end": 14.01
  },
  {
   "text": "And they pay you for",
   "start": 14.01,
   "end": 15.25
  },
  {
   "text": "it.",
   "start": 15.25,
   "end": 15.64
  },
  {
   "text": "Really pay you.",
   "start": 15.64,
   "end": 17.01
  },
  {
   "text": "A typical air traffic controller",
   "start": 17.01,
   "end": 18.56
  },
  {
   "text": "in America earns just over",
   "start": 18.56,
   "end": 20.22
  },
  {
   "text": "$144,000 a year.",
   "start": 20.22,
   "end": 22.96
  },
  {
   "text": "The ones at the busy",
   "start": 22.96,
   "end": 23.79
  },
  {
   "text": "centers clear $185,000,",
   "start": 23.79,
   "end": 26.71
  },
  {
   "text": "and with enough overtime,",
   "start": 26.71,
   "end": 28.16
  },
  {
   "text": "past $250,000.",
   "start": 28.16,
   "end": 30.88
  },
  {
   "text": "You don’t even strictly need",
   "start": 30.88,
   "end": 32.13
  },
  {
   "text": "a college degree.",
   "start": 32.13,
   "end": 33.16
  },
  {
   "text": "Just you,",
   "start": 33.16,
   "end": 34.02
  },
  {
   "text": "a headset,",
   "start": 34.02,
   "end": 34.8
  },
  {
   "text": "and nerves of steel.",
   "start": 34.8,
   "end": 36.39
  },
  {
   "text": "Small problem.",
   "start": 36.39,
   "end": 37.41
  },
  {
   "text": "You wouldn’t last a week.",
   "start": 37.41,
   "end": 39.22
  },
  {
   "text": "Not because you’re weak.",
   "start": 39.22,
   "end": 40.37
  },
  {
   "text": "Because almost nobody can.",
   "start": 40.37,
   "end": 42.42
  },
  {
   "text": "The job you’re picturing,",
   "start": 42.42,
   "end": 43.56
  },
  {
   "text": "the calm voice and the",
   "start": 43.56,
   "end": 44.67
  },
  {
   "text": "six-figure federal paycheck,",
   "start": 44.67,
   "end": 46.41
  },
  {
   "text": "is real.",
   "start": 46.41,
   "end": 47.43
  },
  {
   "text": "What you’re not picturing is",
   "start": 47.43,
   "end": 48.96
  },
  {
   "text": "the thing underneath it.",
   "start": 48.96,
   "end": 50.6
  },
  {
   "text": "By the end of this",
   "start": 50.6,
   "end": 51.28
  },
  {
   "text": "video,",
   "start": 51.28,
   "end": 51.7
  },
  {
   "text": "you’ll understand why that enormous",
   "start": 51.7,
   "end": 53.53
  },
  {
   "text": "salary isn’t a reward.",
   "start": 53.53,
   "end": 55.18
  },
  {
   "text": "It’s a warning label.",
   "start": 55.18,
   "end": 56.39
  },
  {
   "text": "And you’ll understand what this",
   "start": 56.39,
   "end": 57.84
  },
  {
   "text": "job quietly does to the",
   "start": 57.84,
   "end": 59.35
  },
  {
   "text": "people who do survive it,",
   "start": 59.35,
   "end": 61.24
  },
  {
   "text": "the thing that follows them",
   "start": 61.24,
   "end": 62.47
  },
  {
   "text": "out of the tower,",
   "start": 62.47,
   "end": 63.37
  },
  {
   "text": "into their cars,",
   "start": 63.37,
   "end": 64.4
  },
  {
   "text": "into their marriages,",
   "start": 64.4,
   "end": 65.6
  },
  {
   "text": "and never quite lets go.",
   "start": 65.6,
   "end": 67.53
  },
  {
   "text": "Okay.",
   "start": 67.53,
   "end": 67.98
  },
  {
   "text": "Let’s start with whether they’d",
   "start": 67.98,
   "end": 69.11
  },
  {
   "text": "even let you in.",
   "start": 69.11,
   "end": 70.28
  },
  {
   "text": "You can’t even begin this",
   "start": 70.28,
   "end": 71.6
  },
  {
   "text": "career after you turn 31.",
   "start": 71.6,
   "end": 73.68
  },
  {
   "text": "That’s a hard federal cutoff,",
   "start": 73.68,
   "end": 75.34
  },
  {
   "text": "and it exists for a",
   "start": 75.34,
   "end": 76.57
  },
  {
   "text": "brutal little reason we’ll come",
   "start": 76.57,
   "end": 78.02
  },
  {
   "text": "back to.",
   "start": 78.02,
   "end": 78.94
  },
  {
   "text": "Say you make it under",
   "start": 78.94,
   "end": 79.75
  },
  {
   "text": "the wire.",
   "start": 79.75,
   "end": 80.37
  },
  {
   "text": "You get shipped to the",
   "start": 80.37,
   "end": 81.38
  },
  {
   "text": "FAA Academy in Oklahoma City.",
   "start": 81.38,
   "end": 83.74
  },
  {
   "text": "And here’s the first number",
   "start": 83.74,
   "end": 85.11
  },
  {
   "text": "that should scare you.",
   "start": 85.11,
   "end": 86.36
  },
  {
   "text": "In 2024,",
   "start": 86.36,
   "end": 87.56
  },
  {
   "text": "more than 30% of trainees",
   "start": 87.56,
   "end": 89.49
  },
  {
   "text": "washed out.",
   "start": 89.49,
   "end": 90.48
  },
  {
   "text": "When the Department of Transportation’s",
   "start": 90.48,
   "end": 92.14
  },
  {
   "text": "inspector general dug into that",
   "start": 92.14,
   "end": 93.95
  },
  {
   "text": "failure rate,",
   "start": 93.95,
   "end": 94.68
  },
  {
   "text": "the FAA didn’t even argue.",
   "start": 94.68,
   "end": 96.85
  },
  {
   "text": "The agency admitted,",
   "start": 96.85,
   "end": 97.98
  },
  {
   "text": "flat out,",
   "start": 97.98,
   "end": 98.77
  },
  {
   "text": "that its own washout rate",
   "start": 98.77,
   "end": 100.23
  },
  {
   "text": "was unacceptable.",
   "start": 100.23,
   "end": 102.02
  },
  {
   "text": "And at some places it’s",
   "start": 102.064,
   "end": 103.414
  },
  {
   "text": "far worse than one in",
   "start": 103.414,
   "end": 104.854
  },
  {
   "text": "three.",
   "start": 104.854,
   "end": 105.774
  },
  {
   "text": "Picture ten people walking into",
   "start": 105.774,
   "end": 107.544
  },
  {
   "text": "that academy together.",
   "start": 107.544,
   "end": 108.944
  },
  {
   "text": "By the time it’s done,",
   "start": 108.944,
   "end": 110.104
  },
  {
   "text": "more than three of them",
   "start": 110.104,
   "end": 111.194
  },
  {
   "text": "are already gone.",
   "start": 111.194,
   "end": 112.824
  },
  {
   "text": "Now send the survivors to",
   "start": 112.824,
   "end": 114.044
  },
  {
   "text": "a center like Oakland,",
   "start": 114.044,
   "end": 115.194
  },
  {
   "text": "out in California,",
   "start": 115.194,
   "end": 116.124
  },
  {
   "text": "and nearly half of the",
   "start": 116.124,
   "end": 117.584
  },
  {
   "text": "ones still standing never finish",
   "start": 117.584,
   "end": 119.704
  },
  {
   "text": "certifying.",
   "start": 119.704,
   "end": 120.684
  },
  {
   "text": "Start with ten,",
   "start": 120.684,
   "end": 121.494
  },
  {
   "text": "and you might end up",
   "start": 121.494,
   "end": 122.834
  },
  {
   "text": "with four.",
   "start": 122.834,
   "end": 123.674
  },
  {
   "text": "And these aren’t people who",
   "start": 123.674,
   "end": 124.774
  },
  {
   "text": "wandered in off the street.",
   "start": 124.774,
   "end": 126.364
  },
  {
   "text": "They already passed the aptitude",
   "start": 126.364,
   "end": 128.044
  },
  {
   "text": "screen,",
   "start": 128.044,
   "end": 128.534
  },
  {
   "text": "the medical,",
   "start": 128.534,
   "end": 129.314
  },
  {
   "text": "the security clearance,",
   "start": 129.314,
   "end": 130.414
  },
  {
   "text": "and months of training.",
   "start": 130.414,
   "end": 132.034
  },
  {
   "text": "They failed anyway,",
   "start": 132.034,
   "end": 133.184
  },
  {
   "text": "because the thing being tested",
   "start": 133.184,
   "end": 135.024
  },
  {
   "text": "can’t be studied for.",
   "start": 135.024,
   "end": 136.424
  },
  {
   "text": "Trainees describe living in a",
   "start": 136.424,
   "end": 137.774
  },
  {
   "text": "low,",
   "start": 137.774,
   "end": 138.304
  },
  {
   "text": "constant fear that one mistake",
   "start": 138.304,
   "end": 140.344
  },
  {
   "text": "in a simulator ends the",
   "start": 140.344,
   "end": 141.704
  },
  {
   "text": "entire career they uprooted their",
   "start": 141.704,
   "end": 143.674
  },
  {
   "text": "life for.",
   "start": 143.674,
   "end": 144.654
  },
  {
   "text": "One man in training developed",
   "start": 144.654,
   "end": 146.004
  },
  {
   "text": "high blood pressure.",
   "start": 146.004,
   "end": 147.144
  },
  {
   "text": "His sleep fell apart.",
   "start": 147.144,
   "end": 148.554
  },
  {
   "text": "And that’s before he ever",
   "start": 148.554,
   "end": 149.884
  },
  {
   "text": "touched a live plane.",
   "start": 149.884,
   "end": 151.444
  },
  {
   "text": "So why does anyone chase",
   "start": 151.444,
   "end": 152.994
  },
  {
   "text": "this?",
   "start": 152.994,
   "end": 153.544
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow the money,",
   "start": 153.544,
   "end": 154.574
  },
  {
   "text": "because the money is the",
   "start": 154.574,
   "end": 155.784
  },
  {
   "text": "tell.",
   "start": 155.784,
   "end": 156.404
  },
  {
   "text": "An academy trainee starts around",
   "start": 156.404,
   "end": 158.224
  },
  {
   "text": "$45,000.",
   "start": 158.224,
   "end": 159.834
  },
  {
   "text": "Certify at a real facility",
   "start": 159.834,
   "end": 161.324
  },
  {
   "text": "and the number climbs fast,",
   "start": 161.324,
   "end": 162.964
  },
  {
   "text": "past six figures,",
   "start": 162.964,
   "end": 164.594
  },
  {
   "text": "and at the busiest towers",
   "start": 164.594,
   "end": 165.844
  },
  {
   "text": "and centers it keeps going.",
   "start": 165.844,
   "end": 167.844
  },
  {
   "text": "The overtime alone is staggering.",
   "start": 167.844,
   "end": 170.114
  },
  {
   "text": "At the most understaffed facilities,",
   "start": 170.114,
   "end": 172.314
  },
  {
   "text": "controllers pull in tens of",
   "start": 172.314,
   "end": 174.144
  },
  {
   "text": "thousands of dollars in overtime",
   "start": 174.144,
   "end": 175.944
  },
  {
   "text": "in a single year,",
   "start": 175.944,
   "end": 177.244
  },
  {
   "text": "on top of base pay.",
   "start": 177.244,
   "end": 178.764
  },
  {
   "text": "In 2026,",
   "start": 178.764,
   "end": 179.944
  },
  {
   "text": "this one job got a",
   "start": 179.944,
   "end": 181.304
  },
  {
   "text": "federal pay raise carved out",
   "start": 181.304,
   "end": 182.924
  },
  {
   "text": "specifically for controllers,",
   "start": 182.924,
   "end": 184.724
  },
  {
   "text": "at a time when most",
   "start": 184.724,
   "end": 185.834
  },
  {
   "text": "of the government wasn’t getting",
   "start": 185.834,
   "end": 187.254
  },
  {
   "text": "anything special.",
   "start": 187.254,
   "end": 188.604
  },
  {
   "text": "They’re dangling twenty percent",
   "start": 188.604,
   "end": 190.214
  },
  {
   "text": "bonuses at their most experienced",
   "start": 190.214,
   "end": 192.194
  },
  {
   "text": "people,",
   "start": 192.194,
   "end": 192.844
  },
  {
   "text": "the ones already old enough",
   "start": 192.844,
   "end": 194.314
  },
  {
   "text": "to retire,",
   "start": 194.314,
   "end": 195.134
  },
  {
   "text": "just to get them to",
   "start": 195.134,
   "end": 195.864
  },
  {
   "text": "stay one more year.",
   "start": 195.864,
   "end": 197.544
  },
  {
   "text": "And then another.",
   "start": 197.544,
   "end": 199.334
  }
 ],
